    "summary": "Conical tapering snuff bottle.  The body is carved from wood and is decorated on the exterior with a series of alternating incised geometric line patterns.  The collar is decorated with copper (?) wire which has been wrapped around the shaft creating decorative diagonal lines.  The stopper is also carved from wood which has been decorated on the surface with incised line patterns. A length of red-coloured cotton (?) string is attached to a &#039;c&#039;-shaped handle on the side of the container and threaded through holes either side of the stopper.",
